<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on DTB Bund future.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on DTB Bund future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutsche) has issued eight million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the DTB Bund future, lead manager Deutsche Bank AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   16.OCT.96	   LISTING    FRFT, DUSS</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  BUND FUTURE - 99.91 PCT</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT  STRIKE     EXPIRY     ISSUE	GEARING   PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL     100.04 PCT 22.AUG.97  1.79 DEM   55.80 X   1.92 PCT</p>
<p> CALL     100 PCT    21.MAY.97  1.62 DEM   61.67 X   1.71 PCT</p>
<p> CALL     98.0 PCT   21.MAY.97  2.76 DEM   36.19 X   0.85 PCT</p>
<p> CALL     96.0 PCT   21.MAY.97  4.21 DEM   23.73 X   0.30 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	100.04 PCT 22.AUG.97  2.03 DEM   49.21 X   1.90 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	100 PCT    21.MAY.97  1.76 DEM   56.76 X   1.67 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	98.0 PCT   21.MAY.97  0.92 DEM   108.5 X   2.83 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	96.0 PCT   21.MAY.97  0.45 DEM   222.0 X   4.36 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
